  "placement": "Book page 230, topic 8.6.1 অবতল আয়নায় প্রতিবিম্ব: next to চিত্র ৮.২২–৮.২৫ (pages 230–233) and the table 'অবতল গোলীয় আয়নায় গঠিত প্রতিবিম্বের বৈশিষ্ট্য' (page 232); also 8.7 বিবর্ধন (page 234) and the formula 1/u + 1/v = 1/f (page 233).",
  "order": 1,
  "maintainers": ["RadeenXALNW"],
  "units": "cm",
  "description": "Interactive 3D figure for the images in a concave mirror, book pages 229–234, topics 8.6.1 and 8.7, next to চিত্র ৮.২২–৮.২৫ and the table on page 232. The book's pencil XY stands before a concave mirror (f = 15 cm) on an optical bench: beyond F two of the book's rays really meet and a paper screen catches the real, inverted image; at F there is no image; inside F the image is virtual, upright and bigger, behind the mirror. The student drags the pencil from far to near; the book's formula 1/u + 1/v = 1/f, m = l′/l and the book's table follow live.",
  "tags": [
    "light",
